  "design": {
    "entrance": "Smoke spirals inward around a vertical ritual circle whose rings trace on and whose runes ignite one by one; the letters condense out of the vortex through a spiral, edge-glowing dissolve.",
    "reveal": "At the impact frame the circle flares, an energy ring pulses outward and the runes burn bright, then settle to a slow, breathing glow behind a smoked-silver title.",
    "camera": "Locked-off with a slow creeping push and a subtle counter-rotation of the circle layers.",
    "material": "Smoked dark silver with violet rim light and faint inner glow along the edges; glowing runes and rings are emissive and drawn behind the title only.",
    "exit": "The circle collapses inward and the title is twisted into the vortex and swallowed by the smoke."
  },
  "fusion_notes": [
    "The Fusion version draws 6 representative runes as PolylineMasks on a rotating Transform; the preview renders the full 29-rune circle. Add or reshape runes by editing the RuneN polylines."
  ],
